ines  and now the companies must deliver  they must honor their obligations  the coronavirus is continuing to cause  misery around the world  new more infectious strains of the virus  from britain brazil and south africa  are being found in several other nations  making the already approved inoculations  needed now  more than ever now if this increasingly  bitter battle over vaccine is a sign of  things to come  inoculating the rest of the world from  covet 19  will be an even more herculean task than  ever anticipated dana let's just hope  everyone's up for it mts thank you
 

